---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Initialize a new SpecForge project

Usage: specforge init [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --name <NAME>
          Project name (defaults to directory name)

      --version <VERSION>
          Project version
          
          [default: 0.1.0]

      --extensions <EXTENSIONS>
          Extensions to install: builtins and local .wasm files, several to a flag separated by commas

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
